  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2207.11 Revocation of Municipal Winter Maintenance Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2207.11 Revocation of Municipal Winter Maintenance Certificate. If after issuing an initial or renewal certificate the department receives reliable information suggesting that just cause, as specified in Env-Wq 2207.12, exists to revoke the certification, the department shall proceed in accordance with RSA 541-A:30 and the provisions of Env-C 200 that apply to adjudicative proceedings.\n\nSource. #13982, eff 5-24-24",
